   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SCROL</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In this programme, TdH NL will collaborate with seven (7) local partners to address OCSE in 4 countries . Various studies indicate the prevalence of OCSE to be high:
&amp;nbsp;


In Nepal 13% children (18.58% boys and 6.88% girls) experienced live streaming of sexual abuse and exploitation, indicating that many more children are likely to have been groomed and experienced other forms of OCSE.&amp;nbsp;


In the Philippines, 1 in 5 children are victims of different forms of sexual abuse and exploitation.&amp;nbsp;


In Cambodia, 60% of child respondents sampled shared examples of OCSE.&amp;nbsp;

In Kenya, programme evaluations have reported that up to 40% of children surveyed had experienced SEC</narrative>
  </description>
